  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sack farms for child nutrition</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Sack farms for child nutrition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Cie&#x13e;om mikrograntu je zlep&#x161;i&#x165; ekonomick&#xe9; podmienky pre obyvate&#x13e;ov pastierskeho regi&#xf3;nu a v&#xfd;&#x17e;ivu det&#xed; v okrese Moyale. Ide o zavedenie konceptu z&#xe1;hrada vo vreciach v tis&#xed;c dom&#xe1;cnostiach. Po&#x17e;adovan&#xfd; finan&#x10d;n&#xfd; pr&#xed;spevok bude sl&#xfa;&#x17e;i&#x165; na n&#xe1;kup vriec, semien, kapusty, &#x161;pen&#xe1;tu, ako aj &#x161;kolenia matiek/farm&#xe1;rok a dospievaj&#xfa;cich det&#xed;. Popri zabezpe&#x10d;en&#xed; v&#xfd;&#x17e;ivovej hodnoty v ka&#x17e;dodennej strave pre deti a dom&#xe1;cnosti, pr&#xed;jmy nadobudnut&#xe9; z predaja prebytkov bud&#xfa; sl&#xfa;&#x17e;i&#x165; na podporu vzdel&#xe1;vania det&#xed;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve economic conditions of people from shepherd region and to provide access to food for children in Dabel in district Moyale. The applicant plans to reach this goal by introducing a concept &#x201c;garden in sacks&#x201d; in thousands of households. Required project will serve for purchase of sacks, seeds of kale and spinach and trainings of mothers/farmers and adolescents.</narrative>
  </description>
